/span></span></span></span></span></span> zeigt die Lage der Ebene im Schrägbild.</p>\n    </div>\n    <svg class=\"graph raum\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 176\" width=\"50mm\" height=\"44mm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs><marker id=\"pf36\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 z\" fill=\"#0E1E4A\"/></marker>\n     <marker id=\"pk36\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5.5\" markerHeight=\"5.5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 z\" fill=\"context-stroke\"/></marker></defs>\n<polygon points=\"29.0,134.4 159.9,101.7 61.8,52.6\" fill=\"#1F7A4D\" opacity=\"0.22\"/>\n<polygon points=\"29.0,134.4 159.9,101.7 61.8,52.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F7A4D\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"  opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"96.1\" y=\"87.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"fl\" fill=\"#1F7A4D\">E</text>\n<line x1=\"65.0\" y1=\"98.4\" x2=\"18.0\" y2=\"145.5\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#pf36)\"/>\n<text x=\"10.0\" y=\"149.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"al\" fill=\"#0E1E4A\">x₁</text>\n<path d=\"M50.6,109.9h6\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<path d=\"M42.4,118.1h6\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<path d=\"M34.2,126.2h6\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<path d=\"M26.0,134.4h6\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<path d=\"M17.9,142.6h6\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"14.9\" y=\"146.6\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"tz\">5</text>\n<line x1=\"55.2\" y1=\"101.7\" x2=\"182.0\" y2=\"101.7\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#pf36)\"/>\n<text x=\"188.0\" y=\"116.7\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"al\" fill=\"#0E1E4A\">x₂</text>\n<path d=\"M78.1,98.7v6\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<path d=\"M94.5,98.7v6\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<path d=\"M110.8,98.7v6\" stroke=\"#0E1E4A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<path d=\"M127.2,98.